{"logId": "9e9f4c83-efe6-471b-9002-73721703b920", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [364, 120, 935, 167], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 120.0], [935.0, 120.0], [935.0, 167.0], [364.0, 167.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [400, 231, 543, 267], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[400.0, 231.0], [543.0, 231.0], [543.0, 267.0], [400.0, 267.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因错误的教育惯性或方式，对孩子造成困扰或伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [398, 307, 1421, 342], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 307.0], [1421.0, 307.0], [1421.0, 342.0], [398.0, 342.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：偏重传统父母式的爱，孩子在自己心目中占据最重要的位置，给予孩子无私的爱且希望孩子成才、优秀。（传统）", "block_bbox": [401, 356, 1599, 436], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 356.0], [1599.0, 356.0], [1599.0, 436.0], [401.0, 436.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：偏重朋友式的爱，注重并能够树立孩子独立个性和健全人格的培养。（尊重）", "block_bbox": [399, 451, 1532, 486], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[399.0, 451.0], [1532.0, 451.0], [1532.0, 486.0], [399.0, 486.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与孩子平等相处的状态。（平等）", "block_bbox": [398, 499, 1600, 580], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 499.0], [1600.0, 499.0], [1600.0, 580.0], [398.0, 580.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "block_bbox": [398, 594, 1532, 630], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[398.0, 594.0], [1532.0, 594.0], [1532.0, 630.0], [398.0, 630.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[61]", "block_bbox": [967, 969, 1021, 996], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[967.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8677838444709778, "coordinate": [364, 120, 935, 167], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[364.0, 120.0], [935.0, 120.0], [935.0, 167.0], [364.0, 167.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7927164435386658, "coordinate": [400, 231, 543, 267], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[400.0, 231.0], [543.0, 231.0], [543.0, 267.0], [400.0, 267.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.850287139415741, "coordinate": [398, 307, 1421, 342], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 307.0], [1421.0, 307.0], [1421.0, 342.0], [398.0, 342.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9229379296302795, "coordinate": [401, 356, 1599, 436], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[401.0, 356.0], [1599.0, 356.0], [1599.0, 436.0], [401.0, 436.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8569910526275635, "coordinate": [399, 451, 1532, 486], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[399.0, 451.0], [1532.0, 451.0], [1532.0, 486.0], [399.0, 486.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9181082248687744, "coordinate": [398, 499, 1600, 580], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 499.0], [1600.0, 499.0], [1600.0, 580.0], [398.0, 580.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8643492460250854, "coordinate": [398, 594, 1532, 630], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[398.0, 594.0], [1532.0, 594.0], [1532.0, 630.0], [398.0, 630.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6314072012901306, "coordinate": [967, 969, 1021, 996], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[967.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 969.0], [1020.0, 995.0], [967.0, 995.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）\n\n## 标准等级：\n\n一级【0~1分】：不因错误的教育惯性或方式，对孩子造成困扰或伤害。（底线原则）\n\n二级【1~2分】：偏重传统父母式的爱，孩子在自己心目中占据最重要的位置，给予孩子无私的爱且希望孩子成才、优秀。（传统）\n\n三级【2~3分】：偏重朋友式的爱，注重并能够树立孩子独立个性和健全人格的培养。（尊重）\n\n四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与孩子平等相处的状态。（平等）\n\n五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9e9f4c83-efe6-471b-9002-73721703b920/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F6349ec41ac71c209c35f1677606f8fcc4a3ab5ff6797899132a9aa37eb3ea3ce"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9e9f4c83-efe6-471b-9002-73721703b920/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F848c898cecac1ef6dd3419f11b22db3633f1cf496f13a299b9ad58097b55471c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9e9f4c83-efe6-471b-9002-73721703b920/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A37%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F5810c8d9533b6a2222b4fed91b954cd28bc000b06df81180b195a3e7ce1dca7b"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
